<title>MALAYSIA: Wing Tiek 6-mth net slides 84.57 pct.</title>
<headline>Wing Tiek 6-mth net slides 84.57 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Jan 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   1.22   vs	   4.26</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  1.80   vs	   6.37</p>
<p>    Turnover		   314.98   vs	 405.35</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     1.83   vs	   9.81</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less    0.06   vs  less   0.37</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  less  146.00   vs  less   0.19</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Wing Tiek Holdings Bhd is a dealer in hardware and a civil engineering contractor.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
